@ref Art 99(4) and (5) as enacted (src:eu-ai-act-2024-1689:2013-2027)
GIVEN `the infringement` IS AN `Art 99 infringement`
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`Art 99(4) as enacted the infringement is one that paragraphs 3 to 5 name` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the infringement`
    WHEN `Art 99(3) non-compliance with the prohibition of the AI practices referred to in Article 5` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(a) non-compliance with the obligations of providers pursuant to Article 16` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(b) non-compliance with the obligations of authorised representatives pursuant to Article 22` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(c) non-compliance with the obligations of importers pursuant to Article 23` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(d) non-compliance with the obligations of distributors pursuant to Article 24` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(da) non-compliance with the obligations of providers and operators pursuant to Article 25(2) and (4)` THEN NOTHING  -- VERSION as enacted. NOTHING-kind (silent): point (da) is not in the text as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(e) non-compliance with the obligations of deployers pursuant to Article 26` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(f) non-compliance with the requirements and obligations of notified bodies pursuant to Article 31, Article 33(1), (3) and (4) or Article 34` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(4)(g) non-compliance with the transparency obligations for providers and deployers pursuant to Article 50` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99(5) the supply of incorrect, incomplete or misleading information to notified bodies or national competent authorities in reply to a request` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as enacted
    WHEN `Art 99 another infringement` THEN NOTHING  -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): paragraph 4 names points (a) to (g) and the list is not closed by "only", but no other paragraph names a fine

