    WHEN `Art 99(4)(g) non-compliance with the transparency obligations for providers and deployers pursuant to Article 50` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as amended
    WHEN `Art 99(5) the supply of incorrect, incomplete or misleading information to notified bodies or national competent authorities in reply to a request` THEN JUST TRUE  -- VERSION as amended
