-- Each infringement with its own gate: the group of the obligation concerned.
@ref Art 99(3), (4) and (5)
GIVEN `the date asked` IS A DATE
      `the AI system` IS AN `AI system`
      `the infringement` IS AN `Art 99 infringement`
      `the non-compliance or the supply is established` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
